  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "My name is Lily. I am a girl. I am seven. This is my classroom. It is a big room. Our teacher is Teacher Kim. She is nice. There are ten children in our class.",
      "This is Mia. She is seven. She is my friend. Mia likes animals. She lives next to me. This is Leo. He is seven too. He likes silly clothes. He has a green hat with eyes. This is May. She is new. She is eight. Her house is next to the school. How old are you?",
      "This is Pat. He is May's brother. Pat is a boy. He is five. He is not in our class. He is not a baby. Pat likes my dog, Pip. What is your name?"
    ],
    "summary": "Lily tells us about the children in her class. She gives the name, the age, and one fact for each child.",
